# edge-ai-yocto user-manager presets; installed as user-preset/90-edge.preset.
#
# Ordered before the recipe-generated 98-<pkg>.preset files; first match wins.

# podman.socket stays enabled and starts the API service on the first
# connection. Started eagerly at user-manager start, podman.service races the
# other podman user units for the rootless pause process and exits 125
# ("unexpected fd received from systemd").
disable podman.service
